Portions of tools/AcpKit.Generator and tests/AcpKit.Generator.Tests are derived
from dotacp's `generator/` and `unittest/` directories. Those portions have been
modified. The principal changes are:

  * The JSON layer was moved from Newtonsoft.Json to System.Text.Json, both in
    the generator itself and in every artifact it emits.
  * Reflection-based JSON converters were replaced by converters emitted per
    concrete type, so that generated code carries no runtime reflection and is
    compatible with native AOT compilation and trimming.
  * The generator was extended to emit code for the ACP v2 protocol line
    alongside v1, and to read the `x-deserialize-default-on-error` and
    `x-deserialize-skip-invalid-items` schema hints.
  * Enums are emitted as open (extensible) value types, and fields with ACP v2
    upsert semantics are emitted with an explicit three-state representation.
  * The StreamJsonRpc dependency was removed in favour of a JSON-RPC 2.0
    implementation contained in AcpKit.Core.
  * Target frameworks were changed from netstandard2.0/net472 to net8.0/net10.0.

The Agent Client Protocol schemas under schema/ are retrieved from
https://github.com/agentclientprotocol/agent-client-protocol and are licensed
under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
